## Router 1 Configuration

*Naming the Router*
enable
config t
hostname Router1

*Adding IP Address for each Interface*
config t
int f0/0
ip address 10.0.1.2 255.255.255.0
duplex auto
speed auto
no shut

exit

int f0/1
ip address 10.0.0.1 255.255.255.0
duplex auto
speed auto
no shut

*Checking information for ports on the router*
show ip interface brief



